    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102237" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾰλᾰ-πενθής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bearing great griefs,
				patient in woe</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.222
				</span></i>
			; of persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωτός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					5.157
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<i>toilsome</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑσμῖναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Panyas.
					12.5
				</span></i>
			; <i>woeful</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγγελία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					15.26
				</span></i>
			.</div>
